msgid "For a deeper dive into the AQC-Tensor Qiskit addon, check out the [Improved Trotterized Time Evolution with Approximate Quantum Compilation](/tutorials/approximate-quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution) tutorial or the [qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor).\n"
msgstr "Untuk pemahaman yang lebih mendalam tentang addon Qiskit AQC-Tensor, cek tutorial [Improved Trotterized Time Evolution with Approximate Quantum Compilation](/tutorials/approximate-quantum-compilation-for-time-evolution) atau [repositori qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-aqc-tensor).\n"

